diff --git a/CHANGELOG.rst b/CHANGELOG.rst
index 708269a..901166f 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.rst
+++ b/CHANGELOG.rst
@@ -19,7 +19,8 @@ Fixed
 Added
 ~~~~~
 
-`v2.9.0 <https://github.com/jpadilla/pyjwt/compare/2.8.0...2.9.0>`__
+- Allow using a ``PyJWK`` as a key when encoding JWS and JWT tokens. The signing algorithm is inferred from the JWK (its ``alg`` property) when the ``algorithm`` parameter is not provided; for non-JWK keys, ``HS256`` remains the default. by @opensauce in `#994 <https://github.com/jpadilla/pyjwt/pull/994>`__
+ <https://github.com/jpadilla/pyjwt/compare/2.8.0...2.9.0>`__
 -----------------------------------------------------------------------
 
 Changed
